#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``0`` : Success (or ``--check`` / ``--diff`` with no changes needed; "
"advisory ``long`` diagnostics do not fail ``--check`` unless ``--strict-"
"long``)"
msgstr "``0`` : Tókst (eða ``--check`` / ``--diff`` án breytinga)"

#: ../../source/reference/cli.rst:304
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``1`` : ``--check`` or ``--diff`` found files that would change, ``--strict-"
"long`` saw a ``long`` diagnostic, or any error"
msgstr ""
"``1`` : ``--check`` eða ``--diff`` fann skrár sem myndu breytast, eða "
"einhver villa"

